┌ Help — qry 0.1.0 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ ↑                    up                                    ctrl-1–9   switch to session N                            │
│ ↓                    down                                  ctrl-PgDn  next session                                   │
│ ←                    left                                  ctrl-PgUp  previous session                               │
│ →                    right                                 ctrl-w     close this session                             │
│ PgUp                 up a page                             shift-Enter in the tree opens another session on a        │
│ PgDn                 down a page                           connection                                                │
│ ctrl-Home            to the top                                                                                      │
│ ctrl-End             to the bottom                         Dialogs                                                   │
│ Home                 start of the line                     ctrl-q     quit                                           │
│ End                  end of the line                       F1         show / hide the help                           │
│ Enter                new line                              ←          left                                           │
│ Tab                  indent                                →          right                                          │
│ ctrl-←               previous word                         Home       start of the line                              │
│ ctrl-→               next word                             End        end of the line                                │
│ shift-←              select left                           Esc        cancel / close                                 │
│ shift-→              select right                          Enter      submit                                         │
│ shift-↑              select up                             Tab        next field                                     │
│ shift-↓              select down                           shift-Tab  previous field                                 │
│ ctrl-shift-←         select the previous word              Space      next choice                                    │
│ ctrl-shift-→         select the next word                  Backspace  delete the character before                    │
│ shift-Home           select to the start of the line       Del        delete the character after                     │
│ shift-End            select to the end of the line                                                                   │
│ ctrl-a               select all                            Command palette                                           │
│ Backspace            delete the character before           ctrl-q     quit                                           │
│ Del                  delete the character after            F1         show / hide the help                           │
│ ctrl-w               delete the word before                ctrl-p     command palette                                │
│ alt-d                delete the word after                 ↑ ctrl-k   up                                             │
│ ctrl-k               delete to the end of the line         ↓ ctrl-j   down                                           │
│ ctrl-z               undo                                  ←          left                                           │
│ ctrl-y ctrl-shift-z  redo                                  →          right                                          │
│ ctrl-x               cut                                   PgUp       up a page                                      │
│ ctrl-v               paste                                 PgDn       down a page                                    │
│                                                            Home       start of the line                              │
│ Editor · Running                                           End        end of the line                                │
│ F5 alt-r ctrl-Enter  run the statement                     Esc        cancel / close                                 │
